1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,061
Itni garmi mein kaam dhoondhte-dhoondhte paseene chhoot gaye.

2
00:00:04,361 --> 00:00:08,997
Pappu, isi garmi ko business bana! Ganne ke juice ka thela laga!

3
00:00:09,297 --> 00:00:11,839
Machine to bahut mehngi hogi, Chacha?

4
00:00:12,139 --> 00:00:16,949
Motor wali machine aur thela, sab milakar lagbhag 70 hazaar.

5
00:00:17,249 --> 00:00:24,337
Machine saaf rakhna, barf saaf paani ki, aur nimbu-adrak daalna. Log swaad ke liye laut kar aate hain.

6
00:00:24,887 --> 00:00:28,761
Bhaiya, ek bada glass, barf daal ke! Gala sookh gaya!

7
00:00:29,061 --> 00:00:31,917
Thanda-thanda ganna juice. 30 rupaye glass!

8
00:00:32,217 --> 00:00:38,496
Ek glass mein ganna bas 6-7 rupaye ka. Garmi mein din ke 3 hazaar tak bachte hain.

9
00:00:38,796 --> 00:00:43,698
Par ye seasonal hai. Sardi mein yahi thela soup ya bhutte ka bana dena.

10
00:00:43,998 --> 00:00:46,746
Garmi aayi, paisa laayi! Pappu ki life set!
